		{"id":"question","type":"text","text":"## Research question\n\nState one question that evidence can answer.\n\n**Origin:** AI starter, literature gap, or your own reading\n**Status:** open, provisional, or resolved\n**Current confidence:** low, medium or high","x":880,"y":0,"width":460,"height":201,"color":"6"},
